---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party content

The literature corpus in data/corpus/corpus.jsonl consists of bibliographic
metadata and abstract text retrieved from Europe PMC, the arXiv API and
Crossref. Abstracts remain the property of their respective publishers and
authors and are redistributed here under the terms of those services for
research purposes. Remove or replace the snapshot before any commercial use.

One record (`manual:rahim2025-mci-ad-multiview`) is an author-supplied summary
of the repository owner's own publication, clearly tagged
`author_supplied_summary` in the data; its bibliographic metadata was verified
against Crossref (DOI 10.1016/j.imavis.2025.105491).
